Hi {Owner},

I build websites for home inspectors around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews, but no site where a buyer or their agent can see your prices, look at a sample report and book a slot on the spot.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: online booking with radon, sewer scope and termite add-ons, prices by house size, a sample report page, a realtor partner page and an inspection-day guide for first-time buyers, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
